{"id":"afectado","lemma":"afectado","pos":"adj","rank":3852,"glosses":["affected","unnatural; awkward"],"ipa":"/afeɡˈtado/","forms":{"feminine":"afectada","masculinePlural":"afectados","femininePlural":"afectadas"},"examples":[{"text":"Fumar le ha afectado su salud.","en":"Smoking has affected his health.","words":[{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"bless you"}]},{"text":"Su reputación se vio muy afectada por esto.","en":"Her reputation was hurt a lot by this.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"reputation"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null,null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Estoy afectado.","en":"I'm hit!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302773","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Los edificios fueron afectados por la tormenta anoche.","en":"The buildings were damaged by the storm last night.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"building","l":"edificio"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"storm"},{"g":"last night"}]},{"text":"La huelga ha afectado a la economía nacional.","en":"The strike affected the nation's economy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610759","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"strike, protest"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"economy"},{"g":"national, nationwide"}]}]}